    "id":  10249,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Spot LED SMD 10W 110° GU10 -1200Lm- OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835",
    "reference":  "GU1010WOSR-CW-91138",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eExperience the future of lighting with our \u003cstrong\u003e10W LED Dicroica.\u003c/strong\u003e With its advanced \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835\u003c/strong\u003e chip, this technological marvel offers exceptional brightness and unrivaled energy efficiency. Its \u003cstrong\u003e110°\u003c/strong\u003e angle ensures a wide and uniform distribution of light, illuminating every corner of your space with clarity and style. Switch to LED efficiency with the confidence of OSRAM and transform your lighting into a unique and sustainable experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts installation is very simple, just remove the traditional halogen bulb and place the new lamp with \u003cstrong\u003eGU10 socket\u003c/strong\u003e for direct connection to the power supply.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eSpot LED SMD 10W 110° GU10 - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the future of lighting with our extraordinary \u003cstrong\u003e10W LED Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e! With an innovative design and exceptional performance, this bulb is ready to revolutionize your lighting experience at home or in any space you wish to beautify with light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned and manufactured to the highest quality standards, this LED Spotlight perfectly combines elegance and functionality. Its body is constructed from aluminum and PC, a durable and resistant material that ensures excellent heat dissipation, thus extending the lamp\u0027s lifespan and guaranteeing its optimal performance for years.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat truly sets this Spotlight apart is the powerful\u003cstrong\u003e OSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip\u003c/strong\u003e it incorporates. OSRAM is synonymous with innovation and quality in the world of lighting, and this chip is no exception. With its advanced technology, this chip provides exceptional luminous performance, delivering powerful and uniform lighting that will not only illuminate your spaces but also enhance their features and details.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, with a \u003cstrong\u003e110° beam angle,\u003c/strong\u003e this LED Spotlight ensures broad and uniform distribution of light, ensuring that every corner of your room or space receives the illumination it deserves. Whether you need general lighting for a spacious room or focused light to highlight specific objects, this Spotlight adapts to your needs, providing the flexibility you seek in your lighting system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut that\u0027s not all, as the 10W LED Spotlight is also an environmentally friendly choice. Thanks to its high energy efficiency, this bulb consumes significantly less energy compared to traditional ones. By reducing electricity consumption, you will not only save on your electricity bill but also contribute to reducing the carbon footprint, thus caring for our planet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstalling this LED Spotlight is as easy as changing a conventional bulb. Simply remove the old bulb and place this new lamp with a \u003cstrong\u003eGU10 socket.\u003c/strong\u003e Its direct connection to the 220V power supply eliminates the need for additional transformers, further simplifying the process of upgrading your lighting system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe cannot fail to mention that the 10W LED Spotlight has a color rendering index (CRI) of +82. This means its ability to display colors naturally and accurately is exceptional. You will experience a sharper and more authentic visual experience, appreciating vibrant colors and subtle details in all their splendor.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Empotrable-LED-7W-Cuadrado.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the Spot LED SMD 10W 110° GU10 -1200Lm- OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHomes: This bulb is ideal for use in different rooms of the house, such as living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, bathrooms, and hallways. It provides powerful and uniform lighting to create a cozy atmosphere and highlight the decoration features.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOffices and workspaces: The 10W LED Dicroica is suitable for illuminating work areas, such as desks, tables, and reading areas, as it offers clear and bright light to increase productivity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStores and commercial spaces: In retail stores, restaurants, and other commercial spaces, this bulb can be used to enhance product displays and create an attractive atmosphere for customers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePublic spaces: This bulb is useful in public areas such as hallways, lobbies, receptions, and waiting rooms, where reliable and high-quality lighting is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArt galleries and museums: Due to its ability to display colors naturally and accurately, this bulb is suitable for illuminating artworks and exhibits in museums and galleries.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccent lighting: Thanks to its 110° beam angle, this bulb is perfect for illuminating spaces or architectural elements in a broad manner.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutdoor lighting: GU10 bulbs are suitable for use in outdoor fixtures, for garden, patio, or terrace lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy now this product with 3 Years Guarantee in our FactorLED online shop.\u003c/p\u003e",
